window.products.push({"id":969081,"name":"Cybrtrayd Life of the Party Reptile Rocks Fossil Dinosaur Skeleton Chocolate Candy Mold in Sealed Protective Poly Bag Imprinted with Copyrighted Cybrt","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.44,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51g8K33ewmL._AC_.jpg","description":"Become your own chocolatier with CybrTrayd’s complete line of confectionary making supplies! We offer a variety of food-grade PETG plastic molds that are durable and can be reused for a multitude of projects. Create chocolates for all occasions using our traditional shapes for cookie and cake molds or invest in more elaborate 3-D designs. Each mold is sealed in a poly bag with CybrTrayd instructions imprinted on it. This will provide details on chocolate melting and molding for all our molds, including the hollow 3-D molds. In addition, we’ve provided some tips and tricks for getting the best possible results. All of our plastic designs can also be used for soap making. Additional directions are provided soap melt & pour techniques.To prevent any damage to your mold please wash by hand and do not put it in the dishwasher. These plastic molds are not meant to be used with hard candy. The molds are not suitable for children under 3 and should only be used by older children with adult supervision.Chocolates make great favors or treats for parties and other special occasions. Use the hearts, strawberries, rose and other flowers for romantic gestures such as wedding favors or a Valentine’s Day surprise. Trees, ornaments, candy canes and other festive references are perfect for the holiday season. All of our adorable baby molds are ideal for showers and gender reveal parties. You can also add pop sticks to some of the chocolates and create lollipop celebrations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51g8K33ewmL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CybrTrayd","source_asin":"B000EJPKF2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-969081","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000EJPKF2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000EJPKF2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":969082,"name":"Copper jigger lacquered for the shine and to prevent tarnish. - Double 1oz/2oz copper measuring jigger for cocktail mixing. - Solid hammered copper 22","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71onMEG50hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100 % SOLID COPPER. Mosscoff jigger is of the highest quality copper that complies to food grade regulations, made of 22-gauge copper plate. EACH JIGGER IS UNIQE. Each jigger is handcrafted by experienced artisans, hammered and polished to perfection. Its beautiful surface is covered with food safe lacquer to keep the shine and prevent the jigger from tarnishing. 1-OUNCE/2-OUNCE SIDE gives you the right proportion of alcohol in your favorite drink. PERFECT FOR SHOTS. Looks great with a slice of lime on it for tequila or vodka shots. Double-sided copper jigger shot glass is what you need if you are fond of drinking games. SAFE PURCHASE. Love it or get full refund. However, we are sure once you have it you will never want to give it back.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71onMEG50hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mosscoff","source_asin":"B06XGCB8R7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-969082","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XGCB8R7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XGCB8R7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
