window.products.push({"id":969089,"name":"Deluxe Copper Crisper - 2-Pieces Nonstick Oven Air Fryer Pan/Tray & Mesh Basket Set - Air Fryer in Oven - Ideal for French Fry - Frozen Food, Baking S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.23,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iDb8c5O6L._AC_SL1181_.jpg","description":"Simple and easy to make crispy right in the comfort of your own kitchen with air fryer in oven . Enjoy cooking again and make the meals that grandma used to make! It’s fun and easy, so impress your friends, family and loved ones, and do it in a healthy way!No need flipping and turning your food through cooking! The Wonder Crisper allows you to focus time and effort on more important things!Non-stick finish takes the struggle out of lifting your stuck-on food and eliminates tough stains or burnt messes.The tray collects any grease, drippings or crumbs to protect your oven from the hard-to-clean mess.Reduce calories with no need to add oil, butter or cooking spray! Living better begins with eating better.Nonstick, and dishwasher safe for hassle-free cleaning.Suitable for use in any pan or gas oven or grill withstanding temperatures up to 500°FHeat resistant coating is 100% PFOS, PTFE, and PFOA-free.Box Contains:2-piece nonstick copper crisper oven air fryer pan set1 x Grill Basket: 8.9\" x 11.9\"1 x Baking Tray: 9.6\" x12.8\"Care & Maintenance Tips:Wash it using warm water & mild dish soap, and dry it completely with a soft cotton before first use Use nonmetallic utensils made of plastic, silicone or wood to protect the non-stick coating layer Always let the cookware cool before washingRecommend hand wash! Also can be placed in the dishwasher, top rack only","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iDb8c5O6L._AC_SL1181_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PINSUKO","source_asin":"B07W68GRKR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-969089","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07W68GRKR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07W68GRKR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":969090,"name":"Fashion Printed Door Curtains, Self-Adhesive Door Curtain Portable Blackout Curtains are Suitable for Doors and Windows, Cactus Double-Sided Printing ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yV5hHpBcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Specifications Name:Portable Blackout Curtains Material: Polyester Shading rate: 80 90 Percent Color: Green plants, Cactus small potted plants Size: 26x68inch, 26x40inch Product List: 1 x Door Curtain Features: The curtains can block 80 90 Percent of light and UV rays, bringing you a good sleep. Blackout curtains effectively protect your furniture and artwork from fading when exposed to sunlight. Door shades are made of insulating materials to help you save on energy costs. Helps protect complete privacy and ensures that personal space is not disturbed Washing method: Machine washable, hand wash or dry clean recommended. Washing temperature below 76 Degree F. Recommend using a flexible detergent and do not bleach. If necessary, iron at low temperature. This nordic style curtain showcases a classic pattern with a fresh appeal that will instantly enhance the beauty of any room. Blackout curtains provide privacy and block most of the light from entering, preventing the furniture from being exposed to sunlight and affecting its use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yV5hHpBcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"N\\C","source_asin":"B08PSCWVRG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-969090","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PSCWVRG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PSCWVRG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":969091,"name":"Madison Park Cadence Comforter Set, Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ave-7Z+6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Freshen up your space with the modern style of Madison Park’s Cadence 9 Piece Cotton Sateen Comforter Set. Flaunting a chic geometric print in vivid grey and white hues with printed metallic details, this comforter adds a striking contemporary appeal to your bedroom. A solid grey reverse provides a neutral touch to comforter, while matching shams spread the stunning look to the head of the bed. Three decorative pillows incorporate embroidery and fabric manipulation to add charm and texture to the top of the bed. The solid grey bed skirt completes the look with a clean finish. Made from cotton sateen, this comforter set has an elegant sheen and is machine washable. Two pillowcases with geometric embroidery along the hems are also included to complete the collection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ave-7Z+6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Madison Park","source_asin":"B074H9D6W2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-969091","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074H9D6W2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074H9D6W2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":969092,"name":"Pillow Perfect Outdoor/Indoor Gerardo Italian Denim Loveseat Cushion, 44\" x 19\", Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81okoz90IDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Inspired by the intricate shibori cloth-dying technique, Gerardo Italian Denim Blue features a navy and white geo print. This simple pattern is perfect for just about any living space – poolside, patio/deck, or living room. Gerardo Italian Denim Blue was created to be paired with a number of other Pillow Perfect patterns and solids and is available in a variety of pillow/cushion shapes and sizes on Amazon.com.For more than 30 years, Pillow Perfect has been designing and manufacturing decorative pillows and outdoor furniture cushions for the largest online and brick-and-mortar retailers in the United States. We have always been focused on providing the highest level of quality, service, and style, and our talented in-house creative team is constantly watching design and color trends, ensuring that we are always ahead of the curve. Founded by current CEO/Owner Paul and his brother David in 1989, Pillow Perfect products have always been proudly made in the USA, and our Woodstock, GA facility is truly where the magic happens. Each pillow is cut, sewn, labelled, filled, and finished by our team of dedicated employees so you can enjoy it on your sofa, chaise lounge, or in your personal backyard oasis.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81okoz90IDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pillow Perfect","source_asin":"B08CP1ZBZ7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-969092","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CP1ZBZ7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CP1ZBZ7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
