window.products.push({"id":969168,"name":"Touchless Trash Can,3.2 Gallon Waterproof Automatic Smart Bathroom Garbage Can with Lid, Slim Motion Sensor Plastic Narrow Trash Bin for Bedroom, Kitc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31vs4BDVjyL._SL1000_.jpg","description":"NOTICE FOR CUSTOMERS: This product is a motion sensor trash can. Customers need to use USB charging as well as follow the steps to put on the garbage bag to ensure the bin works properly.Then you need to press the power button on the lid for more than 3 seconds to start it.When the light is on, the smart trash can is locked and can't be opened, After the light is off, the touchless garbage bin can be opened normally. So please don't try to open the trashcan lid when the light is on. Smart Trash Can built-in Chargeable Lithium Battery(No need to install battery), which has high capacity and long endurance. It can be charging with less than 5V of USB power.Unnecessary to use power plug & replace battery. 3 MODES INDUCTIVE TO OPEN THE LID: New smart design touchless bathroom trash can, infrared sensor, fast opening in 0.3 seconds, Lid loses in 5 seconds automatically ，wave-sensing touch-free trash can, one-key normally open lid for easy use. Knee bending induction,When you need to open, just gently place your knees on the 8-inch sensing area above the trash can easily open the lid. WATER-RESISTANT: SUNTAI smart trash adopts high-quality materials and Advanced IPX4 waterproof technology prevents water or humid environment from damaging the unit. Leaving none water stain on surface after rinse. SPACE-SAVING: Narrow and ultra-thin barrel, saving home space. 12.9''L×6.8''W×12.9''H, 3.2Gallons, durable ABS materials. SUNTAI smart trash can holds up to 12Liter/3.2Gallon of garbage, Perfect size for limited spaces or narrow gaps.like bathrooms, bedrooms, offices, children's rooms, toilets, campers, RVs and other small spaces. WITH LID DEGISN: The slim oval shape is perfect for narrow space, with a tight cover top that can prevent pets from turning over trash effectively, and good sealing performance can also lock dust and special smell inside. SMART SENSOR: The sensor is sensitive, The lid stays open if your hands stay around the infrared motion sensor. Lid closes after 5 seconds automatically if none movement is detected by sensor. In cases that You want the lid to stay open, just gently touching the weight sensing button on the right, touch the button again to close. HIDE TRASH BAGS TO KEEP TIDY:Easy to lift, fast to pack.when you need to change the trash bag, you only need to open the trash can lid and lift the two side trash bag rope to pack the trash away directly without touching the edge of the trash bag. Keep away from dirt and rubbish. Recommended size of garbage bag：17.8*19.6. CUSTOMER SERVICE:You will get 1* touchless trash can ,1 count garbage bag , 2*perfume flavor tablets.If there is any quality problem with your purchasing, please contact us. We will refund the item value or send a replacement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31vs4BDVjyL._SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUNTAI","source_asin":"B0BLN6B5R4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-969168","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLN6B5R4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLN6B5R4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
