window.products.push({"id":969360,"name":"Sublime Gifts 1 Ounce Package of Water Crystals Deco Beads - Create Your Own Scented Candles or Fragrant Diffuser (Totally Teal)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Aad10vHTL._AC_.jpg","description":"Full Hydrating directions are included. **Please Visit our store to view all 30 different colors of the round water beads. This gem of a product creates glimmering floral or candle arrangements in clear vases and bowls. Ideal for candle, silk and fresh flower arrangements.** Use for weddings, birthdays, parties, graduations, etc.** Easy to use - just add water. Layer your favorite colors for stunning effects. The \"purer\" the water, the larger the crystals will grow. Distilled water is the best. Uses: **Fresh and Silk Flower Arrangements: Crystal Accents are ideal for use in fresh flower arrangements in a crystal cut vase. Mix the polymer according to the preparation instructions. Allow crystals to completely hydrate in a separate container before adding to a vase for floral arrangements. Floating Objects: Crystal Accents make a beautiful centerpiece. Simply fill a glass container (such as a brandy snifter) halfway with the hydrated polymers. Add a candle and place on a mirror for extra shimmer. Ice/Heat Packs: Crystal Accents and Soil Moist polymers can be used as reusable ice or heat packs. Mix the polymer according to the preparation instructions. Allow crystals to completely hydrate and place in a plastic baggie (e.g. zip-lock or heat sealed). Place the baggie in the refrigerator/freezer or microwave for desired application. Cleansing Crystal Accents: If your polymer crystals become discolored or cloudy, simply empty into a colander or strainer and thoroughly rinse with warm or hot water and drain before reusing. Do not dispose of product through drains.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Aad10vHTL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sublime Gifts","source_asin":"B07C45S1TL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-969360","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C45S1TL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C45S1TL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":969361,"name":"Set Of Two (2) - Romanian Crystal Glasses/Barware - Black Swirl/Stained Glass Pattern - Milano Noir Design - 16 Oz Oversized White Wine Glassware","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41TatEyxM-L._AC_.jpg","description":"Each piece in this line of mouth blown, hand decorated, lead free, 24% crystal has been individually hand-crafted in the European country of Romania. The Milano Noir Collection provokes the mind and stimulates the eyes with its unpredictable swirl design, and stained glass like finish. The stained glass appearance is all hand painted with vivid colors within the black line pattern using different colored lusters. Not only is the creative process time consuming, it is also demanding. Each glass is a piece of art created by a worker best described as an artisan. Quality glassware like this is sought after throughout the world. As with all handcrafted works of art, no two are exactly alike which confirms the one of a kind uniqueness of these pieces. Each piece goes through a rigorous quality control process insuring only the highest quality.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41TatEyxM-L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Creative Structures","source_asin":"B004E0DCKM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-969361","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004E0DCKM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004E0DCKM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
