window.products.push({"id":969379,"name":"Air Fryer Disposable Paper Liner, 100PCS Non-sticky Air Fryer Paper, 6.3\" Baking Paper liner, Oil-proof, Water-proof Natural Parchment Paper liner for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qxI8LFHuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⭐【Healthy and Reliable Material】Our Cooking Baking Paper Liner Using food-grade parchment Paper, this Natural Air Fryer Parchment Paper liner is waterproof, oil-proof, non-stick, 100% healthy, and with nice heat resistance, can withstand temperatures up to 428 degrees Fahrenheit. And it has no effect on the taste of food. ⭐【Easy to Use】These non-stick disposable air fryer liners are designed with a round bowl shape, which do not need to tear, fold, cut, nor bend, and you can directly put it in when you are ready to cook. Its heightened edge 4.5cm can protect the side of fryers and prevent food from sticking to them. ⭐【Widely Used】 The Air fryer paper liners are widely used for air fryer basket, microwave, oven, steamer, frying pan, cooker, etc. Suitable for baking, frying, grilling, roasting. like french fries, steak, pizza or chicken wings, etc. In occasion of outdoor camping, home baking, BBQ. ⭐【Keep your air fryer clean】These disposable air fryer liners can effectively keep your air fryer clean and grease free,no sticky mess, and It makes the air fryer easier to work and clean up after cooking with air fryer parchment liners, a great benefit to prolong the life span of your air fryer. ⭐【Kind Reminder】1.Never put empty parchment paper liner in the air fryer, even in pre-heating mode. Please ensure the air fryer paper liner is weighed down by sufficient foods to avoid it blowing around inside and getting stuck in the heating element, which may cause it to burn. 2.The size of this airfryer parchment liners is Diameter bottom 6.3\"(16 cm); diameter top 7.9\"(20 cm); height 1.8\"(4.5 cm). Please measure first if your air fryer is suitable for use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qxI8LFHuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CoekMoed","source_asin":"B09WZ513LC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-969379","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WZ513LC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WZ513LC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
