window.products.push({"id":969445,"name":"200 Pack Parchment Paper Rounds, 6 Inch Baking Parchment, Dual-Sided Wax Round Parchment Paper for Cake Pan, Springform Pan, Tortilla Press, Circles","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HbRXR1nzL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"🥯Paper That You Bake：I hope I’ve convinced you to give parchment paper a try. Once you see the benefits for yourself, you’ll never be without it! Precut-no more cutting circles, greatly save you time. 🌯Became a Key Part of Baking Paper: Using parchment paper creates a thin airy layer between the baking sheet and the paper that helps regulate the temperature, and neutralize hot spots.Heat resistance up to 446 ℉ /230 ℃ , perfect for toaster oven, tortilla press, cheesecake pan and so on. 🥨Reduces Undesirable Spreading: There’s nothing worse than flat greasy-looking cookies. Parchment paper gives cookie dough something to hold on to, for fuller cookies that do not to spread too much. When cookies are thicker, they tend to be softer in the middle as well. 🍪Eliminates Sticking: Cookies baked on parchment paper slide right off the baking sheets. Cake pans lined with parchment allow the cakes to flip easily out of pans, without clinging to the bottom.NONSTICK & EASY TO CLEAN. 🥞Clean Cutting: Ever wonder why brownies and bars in photos look so perfect, yet yours are squashed or messy around the edges? If you line pans with parchment before baking, you can easily lift the entire sheet of treats out of the pan by the edges of the paper. This enables neat straight cuts, without the sides of the pan getting in the way. Try it with casseroles as well!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HbRXR1nzL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Geesta","source_asin":"B08CNC6TBR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-969445","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CNC6TBR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CNC6TBR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":969446,"name":"Harley-Davidson Myst H-DMC Textured Ceramic Coffee Cup, Black 15 oz. 3MLM4925","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61T3WTojhdL._AC_SL1005_.jpg","description":"Harley-Davidson Myst Black Coffee Cup, 3MLM4925. Our new 15 oz. coffee cups raise the bar for drinkware. This ceramic cup is durable and light weight. Sleek glossy and textured ceramic mug with a screen printed logo. Large handle for an extremely comfortable grip while you enjoy your favorite beverage. Dishwasher and microwave safe.Evergreen Enterprises is a true family business, started 21 years ago with their parents in Richmond Va, hand-making decorative flags in the garage. Now have a dedicated sales force across the United States and Canada with an office in Ningbo, China. Have become the world's leader in decorative flags, as well as offering quality and value positions in drink ware, home decor, garden and gifts. Goals today remain the same as they were when it started in 1993, to enhance life by offering quality products known for their beauty and functionality.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61T3WTojhdL._AC_SL1005_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Harley-Davidson","source_asin":"B075Y56QL4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-969446","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075Y56QL4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075Y56QL4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
