window.products.push({"id":969483,"name":"Rowenta IS8100 Commercial Garment Steamer 1500W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rqitsu2yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With a unique code-breaking design to streamline performance the new IS8100 steamer is ideal for steaming garments and furnishings around the home. The suitcase inspired “tilt and roll” features enables easy transport. Foot operated pedals for power and cord retraction are convenient and comfortable. Variable steam control lets you control the amount of steam needed for a project. Telescopic pole adjusts height for comfort and pushes down for compact storage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rqitsu2yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rowenta","source_asin":"B002M25Z2C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-969483","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002M25Z2C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002M25Z2C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":969484,"name":"Expandable Wooden Coat Rack Hanger - Retro Wall Mounted Accordion Peg Rack - 13 Hooks for Hanging Coats, Mug, Hat, Bag - Business or Home Decor and Or","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qJ+jcWKbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LELY HOME, WHERE DESIGN COMES ALIVE We are delighted to bring you this vintage / retro accordion peg hanger for all your “hanging requirements”. IN THE BOX: * Folded trellis with 13 hooks * 2 x Back Mountings * 2 x Screws QUICK AND EASY INSTALLATION Place the screws at the appropriate width, hang the trellis onto the screws and tighten. It’s as simple as that and takes just a few minutes. CHOOSE YOUR COLOR You can choose between white and natural wood. The natural wood color can be painted any color to match your interior design. THE MATERIAL Made of renewable pine wood. We do our best to supply only environmentally sustainable, family-friendly, safe and responsible products. 13 HOOKS AND JUST SOME OF THE POSSIBLE USES FOR THE MULTI-PURPOSE ACCORDION WALL HANGER * Hallway / Mudroom / Entry / Foyer - For coats, jackets, hats, scarves, umbrellas, bags, backpacks, dog leashes and other outdoor accessories. * Living Room - Hanging plants, draped fabrics, picture display. * Bathroom - Towels, brushes, and decorative items. * Bedroom - Clothes and jewelry * Kitchen - To hang your coffee cups, hand towel, coat, hat, bags, umbrella, purse hanger and more. * For use in the office or your business - for practical or decorative purposes. Plus many, many more ideas that we haven’t even dreamed of. This expandable coat rack accordion design can be hung horizontally or vertically. ADDING A LITTLE RETRO FLAIR TO ANY SPACE Sometimes it’s just that little extra that really gives the “umph” to your bland space. This is an affordable and practical way to warm up a cold alcove or just add a little style to a boring space. ADD TO CART NOW and do something truly exciting for your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qJ+jcWKbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LELY","source_asin":"B08MZSBW91","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-969484","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MZSBW91","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MZSBW91","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
