window.products.push({"id":969640,"name":"Hamilton Beach 33850 5-Quart Double Dish Slow Cooker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41M46CKY28L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description Hamilton Beach 33158 5 Quart Double Dish Slow Cooker Amazon.com Get twice the options from one compact machine with this double-dish slow cooker from Hamilton Beach. With its 5-quart capacity and multiple cooking methods, the unit comes in handy for everything from roasting chicken to warming chowder. Use the stoneware crock alone to cook an entire roast or the divided dishes inside the crock to keep appetizers warm on a buffet. You can also use the dividers by themselves for extra-quick heating. In spite of all these options, the cooker is still easy to store, as the pieces nest together in one unit. The base features sturdy side handles, raised feet, and a three-temperature dial. Stain-proof and versatile, the crock can go in the refrigerator, microwave, oven, and dishwasher. The glass lid is also dishwasher safe and features a heat-resistant knob handle. Hamilton Beach includes more than 50 recipes for tasty appetizers and entrées. --Emily Bedard Manufacturer's Notice The U.S. Consumer Product Safety Commission announces the following recall in voluntary cooperation with the firm below. Consumers should stop using recalled products immediately unless otherwise instructed. Name of product: Slow Cookers. Units: 2.7 million. Manufacturer: Hamilton Beach/Proctor-Silex, of Glen Allen, Va. Hazard: The handles on the base of the slow cookers can break, posing a risk of burns from hot food spilling onto consumers. Incidents/Injuries:The company has received approximately 4,700 reports of handles breaking, including two reports of consumers who required medical attention for burns. Description: The recalled slow cookers were sold under the Hamilton Beach and Proctor-Silex brand names, which are printed on the front of the base of the unit. The slow cookers are either round or oval, and were sold in solid white and various print designs. They have a capacity of 3.5 to 6.5 quarts. The slow cookers have series codes A through D which are printed on the bottom along with the model number. Hamilton Beach- 33390, 33475, 33575, 33590, 33675, 33690, 33725, 33850, 33860; Hamilton Beach / Portfolio- 33680; Proctor-Silex- 33320, 33320FD, 33325, 33375, 33380, 33625A. Sold at: Discount department stores nationwide from January 1999 through December 2002 for between $15 and $45. Manufacturer Remedy Information Remedy: Consumers will be shipped a replacement slow cooker base. Consumer Contact: Hamilton Beach toll-free at (800) 429-6363 anytime or visit the firm's Web site at www.proctor-silex.com. Media Contact: Kirby Kriz at (804) 527-7299. See more","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41M46CKY28L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hamilton Beach","source_asin":"B00005QF0A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-969640","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005QF0A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005QF0A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
