window.products.push({"id":969869,"name":"Rexzo Unisex 3 Pocket Deluxe Waist Apron for Waiters, Waitresses, and Food Servers– Made in the USA - Many Colors","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51uUvULw73L._AC_UL1231_.jpg","description":"Cotton Drawstring closure machine wash MADE IN THE USA. There is nothing better than premium American made products. This unisex server apron is constructed in the United States with pride, and great attention to detail. YES, there still are garments made in the United States. DURABLE, WELL MADE.  This 3 pocket apron is professional grade, and made from an ultra durable 7.5 oz. poly/cotton twill fabric.  The finish of the apron is both soil resistant and crease resistant, and has reinforced stress points.  It has a “canvas type” texture and is wrinkle free.  The product dimensions are 12 inches long by 23 inches wide (and 36” adjustable ties on each side) for the Regular Size and 15 inches long by 29 inches wide (and 36” adjustable ties on each side) in Extra Large. UNISEX SIZING. This professional grade Rexzo waist apron is made for both men and women. It also has 3 deep front pockets. Please note that this apron has adjustable 36” ties on each side of the apron, so it could adjust for almost any waist size. The precision cut patterns and reinforced stress points are meticulously sewn by our proud team in our USA factory. UNIQUE FABRIC.  Our three pocket waist apron has a unique soil release finish which releases any stains through normal use.  It's color steadfast qualities keeps its vibrant colors.  Unlike many imported products, our Rexzo waiter apron does not use “heat fused” tie ends, but is quality crafted by using better made “finished” tie ends.  The double pockets are each 9”L x 10”W which provide the depth and convenience for quick access to your checkbook, pen, straws, or other essential supplies. IDEAL FOR WAITSTAFF. This is our most popular apron for food service workers. The 3 pocket design enables waiters, waitresses, & bartenders to separate their needed items to service their customers, and reach for them with ease.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51uUvULw73L._AC_UL1231_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"REXZO","source_asin":"B081BC8QSH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-969869","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081BC8QSH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081BC8QSH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
